# Meta / Facebook environment variables for ometzdental.com
#
# All three are optional. The site renders correctly without them but:
#   - NEXT_PUBLIC_META_PIXEL enables Meta Pixel tracking
#   - NEXT_PUBLIC_META_APP_ID sets og:fb:app_id (required for some link preview
#     optimizations on Facebook)
#
# How to get these:
#
# 1. Create a Meta App:
#    https://developers.facebook.com/apps/create/
#    Type: "Business" (recommended for marketing sites)
#    Display name: "Ometz Dental"
#    Contact email: doctora.gabi@ometzdental.com.py
#
# 2. After app creation:
#    - "App ID" (a 15-16 digit number) = NEXT_PUBLIC_META_APP_ID
#    - In Events Manager → "Data sources" → "Web" → Add → Copy Pixel ID = NEXT_PUBLIC_META_PIXEL
#
# 3. Set up Conversions API (server-side) — recommended for accurate tracking:
#    - Events Manager → Settings → Generate access token
#    - Set META_ACCESS_TOKEN (server-only, no NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix)
#
# 4. Restart the deployment:
#    cd /root/paragu-ai-platform/apps/dra-gabriela
#    docker service update --image dra-gabriela:<new-tag> dra-gabriela_web
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NEXT_PUBLIC_META_APP_ID=YOUR_APP_ID_HERE
# NEXT_PUBLIC_META_PIXEL=YOUR_PIXEL_ID_HERE
# META_ACCESS_TOKEN=
